{
  "id": "RAW_3988facdd2",
  "title": "Altman 最关注的老登企业 CEO，白天管公司晚上撸代码",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjgzMzkwMQ==&mid=2653652029&idx=1&sn=9a0d5b518b0fd5355bca9af21834c617",
  "date": "2026-08-27 22:14:00",
  "author": "傅盛",
  "siteName": "傅盛",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>傅盛和龙虾三万</span> <span>2026-08-27 22:14</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212434_083206f.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>奥特曼眼里的AI尖子生</p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">最近Sam Altman上播客，单独夸了一个人——</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Shopify的CEO Tobi Lütke</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。这位老哥也够忙的，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">白天当CEO，半夜写代码</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">到底是什么让Altman把他吹成</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">AI时代最强CEO</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">？今天咱们就来聊聊。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8894472361809045\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1194\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168347\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_4aa273c.png\"></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">· · ·</span></span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">Sam Altman一顿猛夸</span></span></h2>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Sam Altman 最近在一场访谈里花了两分钟夸Tobi，说他是现在</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">最积极拥抱AI的CEO。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1920\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168357\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_296b83f.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他说Tobi从AI最早期开始就一直冲在前面，每次能力出现跃迁，他都是最先扑上去的那个人。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">自己写软件，自己试各种新东西</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，对技术的感知特别深，还隔三差五给OpenAI发很细的产品反馈和模型反馈。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.4713804713804715\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"891\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168355\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_88b9f3b.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">很多人还在那讨论AI到底有没有用的时候，Tobi已经在公司里跟团队讲了：</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">我们不能成为一家NPC公司，必须拥抱Agent，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">不然彻底完蛋了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.0084033613445378\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1190\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168353\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_f655a65.png\"></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">在一众CEO中，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Tobi永远领先六到八个月</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。大概一年前，Tobi就写过一封内部信，要求员工</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">万事问AI</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，遇到问题时第一件事先看看AI能不能解决，当时外面一片炸锅。现在回头看，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">他就是比别人早一步，而且一次又一次判断对了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我一直说企业AI变革，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">一把手必须亲自上</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。Tobi的故事就是最好的案例。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">· · ·</span></span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">老牌巨头也得重开一局</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Shopify 2006年做电商起家，资历相当老了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">它最早干的就是帮商家自己开独立站，后来越做越深，现在商家真要做一门电商生意，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">从开店到收钱再到后面怎么运营，基本都绕不开它这套系统</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"Shopify Store Design in 2026: Best Practices + 15 Examples - TGL\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.525\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1200\" data-imgfileid=\"506168373\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_53ce044.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"194\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">今天App Store里还有</span></span><strong data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"186\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">2.1万多个应用</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">围着这套生态跑。美国每7美元左右的线上零售里，就有接近1美元是在Shopify商家这边完成的。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.22535211267605634\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1491\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168377\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_3f1de0e.png\"></p>\n  <p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"194\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这些数字很容易让人产生一种错觉：</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">公司这么赚钱、增长这么快，现有模式显然跑得挺好，继续做大就行。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">过去可能说得通，但AI时代不一样了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Shopify越做越强，本质上一直在帮人更方便地操作电商软件。商家要上商品、改页面、做营销、看报表，Shopify把这些能力一个个做进后台。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.2328767123287672\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"876\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168371\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_93363d2.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Agent一上来，软件入口很可能直接换掉。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">当用户越来越少亲自操作软件，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">过去围绕菜单、按钮、页面搭起来的SaaS，还应该长现在这个样子吗？</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">Tobi看到的就是这个窗口：等以后回头看2026年，我们会发现这一年，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">每一门生意都有可能被重新洗牌。一定会有人做出一个AI Native版本的Shopify，而那个人会是我。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.012037037037037\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168363\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_38d2f5c.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">所以他现在每天都在问自己：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">如果今天从零开始，你还会把Shopify做成现在这个样子吗？</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">· · ·</span></span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">让AI真正进入公司的骨架</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">所以Tobi推AI的第一步，一直是自己先下场。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我一开始做AI转型，也经常听到下面的同事说“AI现在还不稳定”“这块暂时替代不了”，每句话听起来都很有道理。如果没有用到足够深，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">就很难判断这些到底是事实，还是旧工作方式给自己找的借口。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"419\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">去年他在内部memo里定了一条规矩：</span></span><strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"342\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">下意识使用AI，已经是Shopify员工的基本要求。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">AI不再只是一个可选工具，它开始进入绩效、资源分配，甚至影响团队到底还需要多少人、应该怎么组织。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"419\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.39863325740318906\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2634\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168369\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_0235b51.png\"></span></p>\n  <p data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"525\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">所以后来有了一条著名规则：</span></span><strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"469\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">团队申请更多人和资源之前，要先说明为什么AI完不成。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;Tobi甚至继续往前追问，如果AI Agent已经是团队里的正式成员，这个部门今天还应该长成现在这样吗？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"308\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">所以我们看结果，2022年Shopify的员工加外包大概1.16万人，当年收入56亿美元；到了2025 年，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">员工大约7600 人，收入却已经翻了一倍，做到115.6亿美元</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.42193308550185876\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1614\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168365\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_0a5b053.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\" data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">2025年，Shopify全年收入达到</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">115.6亿美元，同比增长30%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">，平台GMV达到</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">3784 亿美元，同比增长29%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">。到今年Q2，收入还在同比增长</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">34%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.29653679653679654\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1386\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168367\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_ddc467c.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">到这里，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">AI已经进了绩效、招聘、预算和组织设计</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。Tobi 当初说“我们不能成为 NPC公司”，到了这一步才算真的落地。公司不能一边说时代变了，一边所有旧规则一个不动。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">· · ·</span></span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">把Shopify自己重做一遍</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">公司这一通改完，轮到产品做手术了。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">其实Shopify今天的产品也开始越来越不像过去的传统SaaS。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Sidekick就是最直接的例子。过去商家想知道最近为什么卖得不好，要自己打开后台、找数据、一路分析，现在可以直接问 Sidekick。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.2026875699888018\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"893\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168361\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_7c3e614.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他们现在做Agentic Commerce、Catalog API等等功能，让AI Agent可以直接发现商品、理解商品，未来还可以一路参与到交易过程。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.4816053511705685\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"897\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506168359\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_f683a9d.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">所以Tobi说“我要亲手做出AI Native Shopify”，已经在一步一步实现了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">按照我们猎豹的三步走的经验来看，其实Shopify的变革</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，已经从思维到组织走到产品全套了。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">· · ·</span></span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">老板不变，公司很难真变</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这两年我自己也一直在公司推进 AI 变革，看到他这套东西，会非常有共鸣。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">企业谈 AI很容易从员工培训开始，教大家怎么用模型、怎么写Prompt、怎么做Agent。但真正走进去以后你会发现，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">最后很多问题都会重新回到一号位</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.6916666666666667\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_b0bd645.webp\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">技术现在到底走到哪一步了，你自己得有判断；一个已经跑了十年的流程要不要拆，你得拍板；部门还要不要继续加人，预算怎么重新分，现有产品要不要主动推翻过去最成功的部分，这些决定</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">都绕不过一号位</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Sam对Tobi有一句评价，我觉得特别准确：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他不炒作，他只关心今天AI真正能做到什么，接下来它又能做到什么，然后公司该往哪里去。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我们自己也总结了很多经验，现在不光自己用，还在对外输出，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">帮更多企业打造AI Native组织，</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">帮助企业成为AI时代的新物种</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">如果你是老板或者创业者，对如何打造一个AI Native组织感兴趣，欢迎</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: bold;\">扫码报名</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506168380\" data-ratio=\"7.922727272727273\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1100\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260827212433_23eb3ba.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Sam Altman 盛赞 Shopify CEO Tobi Lütke 是 AI 时代最积极拥抱 AI 的 CEO，本文通过他的实践案例说明企业 AI 变革必须由一把手亲自下场，从思维到组织再到产品全面重构。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Sam Altman 盛赞 Shopify CEO Tobi Lütke 是 AI 时代最积极拥抱 AI 的 CEO，本文通过他的实践案例说明企业 AI 变革必须由一把手亲自下场，从思维到组织再到产品全面重构。",
  "summary": "本文从 Sam Altman 对 Shopify CEO Tobi Lütke 的高度评价切入，分析 Tobi 如何通过亲自使用 AI、推动组织变革和产品重构，成为 AI 时代企业转型的标杆。文章指出，Tobi 从 AI 早期就亲自写代码、试用新工具，并给 OpenAI 提供细致反馈；他在内部推行「下意识使用 AI」的规矩，要求团队在申请资源前先说明为什么 AI 完不成，甚至追问如果 AI Agent 是正式成员，部门是否还需如此组织。这些举措带来显著成效：2022 年 Shopify 员工约 1.16 万人、收入 56 亿美元，到 2025 年员工约 7600 人、收入翻倍至 115.6 亿美元，GMV 达 3784 亿美元。产品层面，Shopify 推出 Sidekick 等 AI 原生功能，并布局 Agentic Commerce、Catalog API，让 AI Agent 直接参与商品发现与交易。作者结合自身经验强调，企业 AI 变革最终都绕不开一号位，老板必须亲自判断技术进展、拍板流程重构与资源分配，否则公司难以真正改变。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "企业 AI 变革必须由一把手亲自下场",
      "explanation": "Tobi Lütke 从 AI 早期就亲自写代码、试用新工具，并给 OpenAI 提供细致反馈，这种深度参与让他能准确判断 AI 的真实能力与落地难度，而不是被下属的「AI 还不稳定」等借口误导。"
    },
    {
      "point": "AI 要进入公司的骨架，而不只是工具",
      "explanation": "Shopify 将「下意识使用 AI」设为员工基本要求，并让 AI 影响绩效、资源分配和组织设计，例如团队申请资源前必须先说明为什么 AI 完不成，这使 AI 真正融入公司运营。"
    },
    {
      "point": "AI 时代 SaaS 产品需要被重新设计",
      "explanation": "当用户越来越少亲自操作软件，传统围绕菜单、按钮、页面搭建的 SaaS 形态面临挑战，Shopify 通过 Sidekick、Agentic Commerce 等让 AI Agent 直接参与交易，向 AI Native 产品演进。"
    },
    {
      "point": "AI 变革能带来显著的组织效率提升",
      "explanation": "Shopify 在员工数量从约 1.16 万降至 7600 人的情况下，收入从 56 亿美元翻倍至 115.6 亿美元，GMV 达 3784 亿美元，说明 AI 驱动的组织重构可以同时提升效率与增长。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "我们不能成为一家 NPC 公司，必须拥抱 Agent，不然彻底完蛋了。",
    "当用户越来越少亲自操作软件，过去围绕菜单、按钮、页面搭起来的 SaaS，还应该长现在这个样子吗？",
    "团队申请更多人和资源之前，要先说明为什么 AI 完不成。",
    "他不炒作，他只关心今天 AI 真正能做到什么，接下来它又能做到什么，然后公司该往哪里去。"
  ],
